    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Here comes the stylish garbage game! </h2><strong>A true trash game where you become a janitor and throw out trash! </strong><br><br>This game is a single player trash action game that lets you experience being a janitor and throwing away trash.<br>You can throw away anything you can grab.<br>Throw the trash into the illuminated trash cans in the city!<br>You can master garbage collection in Score Attack mode or enjoy leisurely garbage collection in Free Mode.<br><br><strong>Can you throw away all the trash? </strong><br><br>Playing time<br>10 minutes~.<br><br>Operation Method<br>ASDW Move<br>Left Click Grab Trash<br>Right click Throw the grabbed trash<br>Esc Retire<br><br>Options<br>From Options, you can configure graphic settings, mouse sensitivity, and other settings.",
